#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:6
msgid "The Mixxx Settings Directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Mixxx settings directory contains all user data and settings of your "
"Mixxx installation. If you want to make a backup of your library and all "
"preferences copy the entire directory to a safe place."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:14
msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:16
msgid ""
"You can navigate to the settings directory location manually as described "
"below. Since Mixxx 2.3 you can also open this directory in your file browser"
" from within Mixxx: go to :menuselection:`Preferences --> Library`, scroll "
"to the bottom of the page and click on :guilabel:`Open Mixxx Settings "
"Directory`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:18
msgid ""
"On Windows, the :file:`AppData` folder is hidden, as well as all files and "
"directories beginning with a dot '.' on Linux. So if you have not already, "
"you will need to set your file manager to show hidden files and folders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:27
msgid "**Windows**"
msgstr "Windows 系统"

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Mixxx``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid ""
"Copy this and paste it into the location bar of a Computer or Folder window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%`` is then resolved to ``C:\\Users\\<your-"
"username>\\AppData\\Local``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid ""
"Use ``%USERPROFILE%\\Local Settings\\Application Data\\Mixxx`` if you want "
"to migrate your settings from XP or earlier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:31
msgid "**macOS**"
msgstr "**macOS**"

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid ""
"Mixxx 2.3: ``~/Library/Containers/org.mixxx.mixxx/Data/Library/Application "
"Support/Mixxx``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "Mixxx 2.2 and earlier: ``~/Library/Application Support/Mixxx``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:33
msgid ""
"Due to macOS App Sandbox restrictions, Mixxx cannot automatically access "
"external files or drives (like USBs, or your Music directory). You will need"
" to grant permission manually via a file dialog the first time you access "
"paths outside the sandbox. This permission is saved securely in the "
"container."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:45
msgid "**Linux**"
msgstr "**Linux**"

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "For distribution packages, or Mixxx installed from source:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "``~/.mixxx/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "This resolves to ``/home/<your-username>/.mixxx``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "For Flatpak:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:0
msgid "``~/.var/app/org.mixxx.Mixxx/.mixxx``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:48
msgid "Content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:54
msgid "**analysis**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:51
msgid ""
"This contains all waveform analysis data. This is used to compose a track's "
"scrolling waveform and track overview. If not existent, this data will be "
"recreated each time a track is loaded into a Mixxx deck. Thus it does not "
"belong to the essential data that needs to be backed up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:57
msgid "**broadcast_profiles**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:57
msgid "All broadcast profiles you have configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:63
msgid "**controllers**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:60
msgid ""
"All controller mappings you stored. This can be downloaded and :ref:`self-"
"built mappings <advanced-controller>`, as well as built-in mappings that you"
" modified in :guilabel:`Preferences` > :guilabel:`Controllers` > "
":guilabel:`YourController` manually or with the MIDI Wizard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:66
msgid "**effects.xml**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:66
msgid ""
"The current configuration of the 4 effect units, incl. the state of all "
"controls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:70
msgid "**mixxx.cfg**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:69
msgid ""
"Everything you configured in the Preferences, deck settings, skin settings, "
"AutoDJ configuration, effect routing etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:74
msgid "**mixxx.log[.NN]**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:73
msgid ""
"Log files of the last few Mixxx sessions, with ``mixxx.log`` being the most "
"recent one, followed by ``mixxx.log.1`` etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:78
msgid "**mixxxdb.sqlite**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:77
msgid ""
"The Mixxx library database. All track locations, all track metadata, saved "
"cues, loops, colors, playlists, crates, ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:81
msgid "**samplers.xml**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:81
msgid "Stores tracks currently loaded to sample decks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:89
msgid "**sandbox.cfg**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:84
msgid ""
"This is used under macOS to track which files Mixxx will have access to. "
"Because Mixxx runs inside an App Sandbox on macOS, it cannot automatically "
"access files outside of its container (such as external drives, or the "
"user's Music folder) without explicit permission. When you select a folder "
"or file through a native macOS file dialog, Mixxx safely stores a security-"
"scoped bookmark here so that you do not have to grant permission every time "
"you start Mixxx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:91
msgid "**soundconfig.xml**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/settings_directory.rst:92
msgid "Sound device configuration from Preferences > Sound Hardware"
msgstr ""
